17:06.976 --> 17:11.212
I don't know what I'd do
if anything ever happened to her, Charlie.

17:11.213 --> 17:13.381
I'd go crazy.

17:13.382 --> 17:16.712
I'd go crazy just thinking about it.

17:22.658 --> 17:26.661
Well, then, for God's sake,
don't think about it.

17:26.662 --> 17:30.122
Come on. Come on. Let's get you home.

17:30.232 --> 17:33.968
- Thanks, Charlie. You're okay.
- No problem.

17:33.969 --> 17:38.840
You just kick back and relax. And when
Celeste walks through that door...

17:38.841 --> 17:41.509
...all you gotta do
is act like nothing's happened.

17:41.510 --> 17:45.413
- You think something happened?
- No, no, no. Nothing happened.

17:45.414 --> 17:47.282
Which is why it's not really acting.

17:47.283 --> 17:50.084
And it'll show your daughter
that you trust her.

17:50.085 --> 17:54.589
- Okay, I'll give it a shot.
- You won't be sorry, I promise.

17:54.590 --> 17:55.790
Okay.

17:55.791 --> 17:57.225
Hey, come over to the house.

17:57.226 --> 18:00.395
I got a couple of tickets for Sunday's game
I wanna lay on you.

18:00.396 --> 18:07.026
Oh, you don't have to do that.
I'll just grab my keys. Okay, let's go.

18:07.837 --> 18:10.538
What ever happened to the guy
you tackled in the Tampa Bay game?

18:10.539 --> 18:13.529
Uh, Robinson. He's walking again.

18:15.344 --> 18:16.744
JEROME:
Celeste?

18:16.745 --> 18:19.245
Oh. Hi, Dad.

18:21.050 --> 18:23.670
[STAMMERS]
Hey, Mr. Mad Dog.

18:27.189 --> 18:29.779
Am I gonna be walking again?

18:35.264 --> 18:37.764
Listen, Jake.

18:38.634 --> 18:42.470
I'm real proud that you stepped up
and got a little action tonight...

18:42.471 --> 18:44.973
- ...but I gotta ask you something.
- What?

18:44.974 --> 18:48.094
Are you out of your freaking mind?

18:48.544 --> 18:50.912
I'm sorry. We just lost track of time.

18:50.913 --> 18:57.118
Yeah, well, thanks to you, I gotta change
my shorts for the second time today.

18:57.119 --> 18:59.619
There's my phone.

19:00.089 --> 19:01.990
- Who are you calling?
- Celeste.

19:01.991 --> 19:05.031
No, no, no. Cool it with Celeste.

19:05.528 --> 19:08.028
And change your ringtone.

19:08.097 --> 19:09.597
[KNOCKlNG ON DOOR]

19:09.598 --> 19:12.098
Ah, now what?

19:23.846 --> 19:26.616
I'll be with you in a minute.

19:26.949 --> 19:31.452
Jake, go to your room.
No matter what you hear, do not come out.

19:31.453 --> 19:33.953
- What?
- Just go.

19:34.890 --> 19:37.390
[SlGHS]

19:40.095 --> 19:42.564
Look, I spoke to the kid.

19:42.565 --> 19:45.099
He's not gonna bother
your daughter anymore.

19:45.100 --> 19:48.469
So whatever you gotta do, do it to me.

19:48.470 --> 19:50.970
JEROME:
I'm sorry, buddy.

19:52.341 --> 19:55.276
- I overreacted.
- Okay.

19:55.444 --> 19:57.211
Celeste told me everything.

19:57.212 --> 20:00.848
She told me your boy was a gentleman
and that she wanted to kiss him.

20:00.849 --> 20:03.349
She wanted to kiss him?

20:04.320 --> 20:07.722
You may have bigger problems
than you thought.

20:07.723 --> 20:09.891
Hey, here's two tickets for the game.

20:09.892 --> 20:12.660
You take Jake, I'll bring Celeste.
We'll make a day of it.

20:12.661 --> 20:15.096
Thanks. That's great.

20:15.097 --> 20:17.597
- Excuse me.
- Sorry.

20:27.810 --> 20:30.574
Okay. Well, see you Sunday.

20:33.916 --> 20:35.116
[SlGHS]

20:35.117 --> 20:37.642
Alan, where's my car?

20:38.387 --> 20:41.754
Why are you wearing a dress? Alan?

20:41.924 --> 20:43.124
[KNOCKlNG ON DOOR]

20:43.125 --> 20:45.625
Why aren't you in Mexico?
